Z||000004||Supernaut||08-10-2001||12:56 PM||||The answer from this thread<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002629.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002629.html</A> <P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>It is a custom yellow that I picked off a picture of a custom hodrod that was hanging on the wall at the paint store. It became really custom when the guy mixed the paint because the paint code for the color was for Dupont ChromaBase but I went with Dupont Nason instead which is a cheaper paint. The Nason paint does not have a color code for the color so the guy matched the paint perfectly. The difference in the paints is that the Nason is much thinner than the ChromaBase. Hope this helped. If you want the paint code for the ChromaBase I can get it for you.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I like that yellow too.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Supernaut<BR>86 GT (in progress)<BR>86 SE<BR>84 SE<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/signat.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||87GTBro||08-10-2001||01:44 PM||||THATS MY BROTHER'S car!!!  <P>And yes, it is a custom color.  We had it mixed at Carquest auto parts.  It came off a poster on the wall (Like the quote says).  I dont know if I will be able to get the color codes, but I can always "borrow" my brothers car to get it measured!  I'll ask him about it...<P>I can get a few more pictures of it too if you want...  The color really turns heads..  We painted in my my parent's garage in a home made paint booth.<P>The whole job took about 30 hours to do (total) as it was an "off-body" paint job.  I think we have pics before, during and after the painting.  It used to be one of the rare blue ones!!  DONT eveybody scream at once!!  J/K...<P>I had to write something since I helped sand and paint it!!!!<P>------------------<BR>AOL IM: GTFiero86Dan<BR>'86 GT 4 speed<BR>'87 GT Auto<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/87GTBrosig1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by 87GTBro (edited 08-10-2001).]||||reg||1
